==English==

===Noun===
[[File:Illu bladder.jpg|thumb|right|The urinary bladder.]]
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} An elastic, muscular sac situated in the pelvic cavity, into which [[urine]] from the [[kidney]]s is temporarily stored prior to disposal by [[urination]]. Urine enters the bladder via the [[ureter]]s and exits via the [[urethra]].

